cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below.
title: "glasshouse v0.1: a long-term memory benchmark for AI systems"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for AI memory systems. 2,847 questions over a conversation that
  runs to 1.97 million tokens, in 10 languages, with 50 photographs. Questions
  are grouped into 17 axes and each axis is reported separately; there is no
  single headline number. Four nested corpus tiers, from 1,882 turns to 103,572,
  carry the same questions so that a score can be read against corpus size.
type: dataset
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-15"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wontopos/glasshouse"
authors:
  - name: "Wontopos"
keywords:
  - long-term memory
  - retrieval
  - benchmark
  - multilingual
  - AI agents
